# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files.
#
# This repository carries tracked ABAP (src/abap/zcl_pg_*, the linked
# examples under src/examples/) that abaplint and the transpiler consume -
# CONVENTIONS §6 asks for this file in every repository carrying ABAP.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.abap text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonc text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
